After termination, You must stop further use and distribution of the Software that requires this License. Termination does not cancel accrued royalties, reporting and record obligations relating to covered activity, confidentiality obligations, or liability for an existing breach.

End users who lawfully received Products before termination retain the limited rights in Section 3 to continue using, backing up, and reinstalling those copies, provided they respect the scope of those rights. Termination does not itself authorize You to make new distributions or grant new licenses. Required notices remain with retained copies.

